Requirement - Complete competitor analysis for in market courses 
Note - I used ChatGPT 5.6 Sol for this
V1 Prompt: You are a product marketing manager, create a competitor analysis with the top 5 key online competitors in the market for the double degree - Bachelor of Computer Science + Master of Data Science. Include the university name, course name, price, entry requirements and a source link in a table format.
====
Response: 
Yes. I’ve treated the market as Australian domestic online study and looked for courses competing for the same prospective student: someone wanting strong computer science foundations plus advanced data/AI capability.

The main finding is useful from a product-marketing perspective: there are very few direct online equivalents offering both a bachelor and master qualification in four years. Most competitors offer either a four-year advanced/honours computer science degree with data science specialisation, or a bachelor followed by a separate online Master of Data Science.

